Momentum 4 Controls is an original GJS implementation.

Backend: momentumctl, MIT licensed, https://codeberg.org/galen/momentumctl
The extended Rust backend is included under momentumctl/, based on upstream
commit e86f3e2. Its original MIT license and Galen Abell copyright notice are
preserved in momentumctl/LICENSE. The extension runs its installed executable.

Protocol research references:
https://github.com/Oein/sennheiser-desktop-client/blob/main/PROTOCOL.md
https://github.com/Ariazonaa/momentum4-control
https://github.com/Zhengyang-Liu/m4-companion
Only protocol facts and independently implemented control code are included.
Android application packages, disassembly and Bluetooth captures are excluded.

Behaviour reference: omarchy-momentumctl, Apache-2.0 licensed,
https://github.com/timmo001/omarchy-momentumctl
No QML source, icons or other assets were copied.

The isolated Shell test harness follows the launch procedure of GNOME Shell's
gnome-shell-test-tool. Its implementation is original.

